        <mxCell id="vESyuJhb2s0FRK3e8iiK-11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;perimeterSpacing=1;strokeColor=default;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingTop=2;spacingRight=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingLeft=2;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontFamily=Cinzel;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DCinzel;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Cinzel&quot;&gt;Gray World&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Lifeless plane populated by mindless husks. Neither touched by sin or virtue during the &lt;b&gt;War Above&lt;/b&gt;. After &lt;b&gt;Selynthar&lt;/b&gt;&#39;s &lt;b&gt;secarsion&lt;/b&gt;, it was populated by humans, where &lt;b&gt;Eclipsia&lt;/b&gt; was founded and the &lt;b&gt;O.B.C&lt;/b&gt;. launches crusades to claim land.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
